        <span itemprop="definition">(melting point: 165° C., crystal dispersion temperature: 90° C.), composed of 20 weight % of an ultra-high-molecular-weight polyethylene (UHMWPE) having a weight-average molecular weight of 2.5 ⁇ 10 6 , 60 weight % of a high-density polyethylene (HDPE) having a weight-average molecular weight of 3.5 ⁇ 10 5 and 20 weight % of a polyethylene having a weight-average molecular weight of 5.1 ⁇ 10 5 was incorporated with 0.375 weight parts of an antioxidant based on 100 weight parts of the polyethylene composition, to prepare a polyethylene composition.</span>
